# Personal Itineraries Platform

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/README.md` before large changes.

## Hard rules

- Domain: personal itineraries + Colombian airports. Not Parche.
- Stack: Next.js frontend, Go backends, RabbitMQ, Redis, Postgres per service.
- Hexagonal per Go service; Adapter for API Colombia; Gateway has no business logic.
- Transactional Outbox for integration events (no unsafe dual write).
- All changes via feature branches + Pull Requests to `main`.
- Update `docs/` in the same PR when architecture or behavior changes.
- Conventional Commits in English.

## Phase awareness

If application code is still absent, prefer docs/ADR PRs over inventing undeclared services.
